/ActualText (One Kind Act a Day Founder, Khorsow Semnani; Curtis Bennett, their Executive Director; and Utah's First Lady, Abby Cox, visited Vineyard and spoke about the profound impact of kindness in a community. They certified our city's efforts and congratulated Vineyard on the progress made to grow together and lift each other as neighbors first.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
