<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Amplifying kindness in a community serves as the catalyst for safe communities, fosters bonds of unity, and nurtures the growth of small businesses. It is the bedrock for leadership in a well-educated society and a formidable barrier against homelessness. It is a free act that preserves individual freedoms and develops good policy. Moreover, kindness yields tangible health benefits and empowers individuals to lead fulfilling lives.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
