/ActualText (The newly constructed 6 million Gallons Water Storage Tank in Vineyard City is vital to the enhanced water infrastructure and doubles as the canvas for the city's heritage mural. Integrating functionality with artistry, the tank becomes a unique landmark housing representing Vineyard's rich heritage and cultural identity. This innovative approach seamlessly blends utility and aesthetics, contributing to the city's distinctive character.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
