/S /P
/ActualText (Vineyard City prioritized environmental enhancement and resident well-being through various initiatives. This includes planting 97 trees in key locations, conducting pruning and removal of hazardous trees for public safety, and collaborating with local entities to address invasive species. The city partnered with UVU to establish the Sunset Park Botany walk, fostering education and showcasing Vineyard's natural beauty. These efforts underscore Vineyard City's commitment to a greener and more vibrant community.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
